Totally, making it functionnal instead of procedural is a big improvement ^^
Making it easier to call and use, and scaling it to multiple sets of different dungeons (you could have dungeons within dungeons for example)
I'm just used to think procedural as its a more "human" approach ^^
There is also a wide variety of possible usage using this technique.
